                                "sense_id": "fa13ad96-ec53-3336-b301-cffbfa0cb677",
                                "text": "But mote thy goodlyhed forgiue it mee, / To weet, which of the Gods I shall thee name, / That vnto thee due worship I may rightly frame."
                            }
